#: backgnd.cpp:137
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Radna površina"

#: backgnd.cpp:146
msgid "&Common Background"
msgstr "&Zajednička pozadina"

#: backgnd.cpp:149
msgid ""
"Choose the desktop whose background you want to modify. If you want the same "
"background settings to be applied to all desktops, check the \"Common "
"Background\" option, and this list will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite radnu površinu čiju pozadine želite da promenite. Ako želite "
"da ista podešavanja za pozadinu budu primenjena na sve radne površine, "
"čekirajte \"Zajednička pozadina\" opciju, i ova lista će biti "
"deaktivirana."

#: backgnd.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to have the same background settings for all "
"desktops. If this option is not checked, the background settings can be "
"customized for each desktop."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovu opciju ako želite da ista podešavanja za pozadinu budu "
"primenjena na sve virtualne radne površine. Ako ova opcija nije čekirana, "
"podešavanja za pozadinu mogu biti konfigurisana za svaku radnu površinu."

#: backgnd.cpp:167
msgid ""
"In this monitor, you can preview how your settings will look like on a "
"\"real\" desktop."
msgstr ""
"Na ovom monitoru, možete da vidite prikaz kako će vaša podešavanja "
"izgledati na pravoj \"radnoj\" površini."

#: backgnd.cpp:175
msgid "&Background"
msgstr "&Pozadina"

#: backgnd.cpp:180 bgdialogs.cpp:679
msgid "&Mode:"
msgstr "&Mod:"

#: backgnd.cpp:193
msgid ""
"You can select the manner in which the background is painted. The choices "
"are: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Flat:</em> Use a solid color (\"Color 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Pattern:</em>"
" Use a two-color pattern. Click \"Setup\" to choose the pattern.</li> "
"<li><em>Gradients:</em> Blend two colors using a predefined gradient "
"(horizontal, vertical, etc.).</li> "
"<li><em>Program:</em> Use an application which paints the background, for "
"example, with a day/night map of the world that is refreshed periodically. "
"Click \"Setup\" to select and configure the program.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati način na koji je pozadina obojena. Mogućnosti su: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Jednobojan:</em> Koristi zatvorenu boju. (\"Boja 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Patern:</em> Koristi dve-boje patern. Klikni na \"Podešavanja\" da "
"bi izabrao patern.</li> "
"<li><em>Senčenje:</em> Senčenje sa dve boje koristeći već definisanu "
"vrstu preliva (horizontalan, vertikalan, itd.).</li> "
"<li><em>Program:</em>"
" Korišćenje aplikacije koja boji pozadine, na primer, sa dan-noć mapom "
"sveta koja se osvežava periodično. Kliknite na \"Podešavanja\" da biste "
"selektovali i konfigurisali.</li></ul>"

#: backgnd.cpp:204
msgid "Color &1:"
msgstr "Boja &1:"

#: backgnd.cpp:212
msgid "Click to choose a color."
msgstr "Kliknite da biste odabrali boju."

#: backgnd.cpp:214
msgid "Color &2:"
msgstr "Boja &2:"

#: backgnd.cpp:222
msgid ""
"Click to choose a second color. If the background mode does not require a "
"second color, this button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite da biste odabrali drugu boju. Ako mod pozadine ne zahteva drugu "
"boju, onda je ovo polje deaktivirano."

#: backgnd.cpp:225
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "&Podešavanja..."

#: backgnd.cpp:228
msgid ""
"If the background mode you selected has additional options to configure, "
"click here."
msgstr ""
"Ako mod za pozadinu ima dodatnu mogućnost za konfiguraciju, onda kliknite "
"ovde."

#: backgnd.cpp:233
msgid "&Wallpaper"
msgstr "&Slika u pozadini"

#: backgnd.cpp:242
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you check this option, you can choose a set of graphic files to be used "
"as wallpaper, one at a time, for an interval ranging from 1 minute to 4 "
"hours. You can also choose to have the graphics selected at random or in the "
"order you specified them."
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberete ovu opciju, onda možete izabrati skup slika koje će se "
"koristiti kao pozadina, po jedna u različito vreme, u intervalu od 5 minuta "
"do 4 časa. Takođe imate mogućnost da se slike selektuje slučajno ili po "
"nekom odredjenom redu."

#: backgnd.cpp:249
msgid "&No Wallpaper"
msgstr "&Bez slike u pozadini"

#: backgnd.cpp:250
msgid "&Single Wallpaper"
msgstr "&Jedna slika u pozadini"

#: backgnd.cpp:251
msgid "&Multiple Wallpapers"
msgstr "&Više slika u pozadini"

#: backgnd.cpp:253
msgid "M&ode:"
msgstr "M&od:"

#: backgnd.cpp:260
msgid ""
"You can have a wallpaper (based on a graphic) on top of your background. You "
"can choose one of the following methods for displaying the wallpaper: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Centered:</em> Center the graphic on the desktop.</li> "
"<li><em>Tiled:</em> Tile the graphic beginning at the top left of the "
"desktop, so the background is totally covered up.</li> "
"<li><em>Center Tiled:</em> Center the graphic on the desktop, and then tile "
"around it so that the background is totally covered up.</li> "
"<li><em>Centered Maxpect:</em> Magnify the graphic without distorting it "
"until it fills either the width or height of the desktop, and then center it "
"on the desktop.</li> "
"<li><em>Scaled:</em> Magnify the graphic, distorting it if necessary, until "
"the entire desktop is covered.</li> "
"<li><em>Centered Auto Fit:</em>"
" If the wallpaper fits the desktop, this mode works like Centered. If the "
"wallpaper is larger than the desktop, it's scalled down to fit while keeping "
"the aspect ratio.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:278
msgid "&Wallpaper:"
msgstr "&Slika u pozadini:"

#: backgnd.cpp:287
msgid "Click to choose the graphic you want to use as wallpaper."
msgstr "Kliknite da izaberete sa kojom slikom želite da prekrijete radnu površinu."

#: backgnd.cpp:290 bgdialogs.cpp:561
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "Pre&gledaj..."

#: backgnd.cpp:293
msgid ""
"If the graphic you want is not in a standard directory, you can still find "
"it by clicking here."
msgstr ""
"Ako slika koju želite nije u standardnom direktorijumu, i dalje je možete "
"naći tako što će te kliknuti ovde."

#: backgnd.cpp:296
msgid "S&etup Multiple..."
msgstr "Podesi &više..."

#: backgnd.cpp:300
msgid ""
"Click here to select graphics to be used for wallpaper, and to configure "
"other options."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovde da podesite slike koje će te koristiti kao pozadinu, i da "
"konfigurišete neke dodatne opcije."

#: backgnd.cpp:305
msgid "&Advanced"
msgstr "&Napredno"

#: backgnd.cpp:310
msgid "B&lending:"
msgstr "&Mešanje boja"

#: backgnd.cpp:318
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have selected to use wallpaper, you can choose various methods of "
"blending the background colors and patterns with the wallpaper. The default "
"option, \"No Blending\", means that the wallpaper simply obscures the "
"background below."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste izabrali pozadinu, postoji veliki broj načina mešanja pozadinskih "
"boja i šara. Podrazumevana opcija je \"Bez mešanja\", što znači da se "
"slika u pozadini uopšte ne menja."

#: backgnd.cpp:325
msgid "B&alance:"
msgstr "&Balans:"

#: backgnd.cpp:333
msgid ""
"You can use this slider to control the degree of blending. You can "
"experiment by moving the slider and looking at the effects in the preview "
"image above."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti ovaj klizač da kontrolišete nivo mešanja. Da biste "
"videli kakve ste efekte proizveli dovoljno je samo da pogledate prikaz slike "
"koji se nalazi gore."

#: backgnd.cpp:336
msgid "&Reverse"
msgstr "&Okreni"

#: backgnd.cpp:341
msgid ""
"For some types of blending, you can reverse the background and wallpaper "
"layers by checking this option."
msgstr ""
"Za neke vrste mešanja, možete okrenuti pozadinu i sliku koja se nalazi na "
"njoj tako što izaberete ovu opciju."

#: backgnd.cpp:344
msgid "&Limit Pixmap Cache"
msgstr "&Ograničen keš za piksmapu"

#: backgnd.cpp:345
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Checking this box limits the amount of memory that KDE will use to save "
"pixmap (raster graphics). It is advisable to do this, especially if you do "
"not have a lot of memory."
msgstr ""
"Biranjem ove opcije limitirate količinu memorije koju KDE koristi da bi "
"sačuvao piksmap fajlove. Ovo je preopručljivo da uradite, posebno ako "
"nemate puno memorije."

#: backgnd.cpp:350
msgid "Cache &Size"
msgstr "Veličina &keša"

#: backgnd.cpp:355
msgid " KB"
msgstr " Kb"

#: backgnd.cpp:360
msgid ""
"In this box you can enter how much memory KDE should use for caching pixmaps "
"for faster access."
msgstr ""
"Ovde možete da unesete koliku količinu memorije KDE će da koristi za "
"keširanje piksmapa, zbog bržeg pristupa."

